        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EtenfAJa6Iqig8aGZorJ-1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Wallet domain manages users&#39; balances, deposits, withdrawals,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;and withdrawal destinations. It is responsible for recording&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;wallet transactions, validating funding requests, ensuring sufficient funds for withdrawals,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;and maintaining an accurate wallet balance.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="119" y="70" width="590" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NBpmdclvkx5bJ0mZVgUL-1" value="&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;621&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-section-id=&quot;zaie7y&quot;&gt;Deposit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;629&quot; data-start=&quot;623&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;Rules:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre data-end=&quot;784&quot; data-start=&quot;631&quot; class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;1. Deposit amount must be &amp;gt; 0&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;2. Payment method must exist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;3. Asset must be active.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;4 Wallet is credited only after confirmation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;5. Confirmed deposits cannot be edited.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;6. Rejected deposits cannot be confirmed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="190" width="466" height="330" as="geometry" />
