        <mxCell id="NBpmdclvkx5bJ0mZVgUL-2" value="&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;621&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-section-id=&quot;zaie7y&quot;&gt;Withdraw&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;621&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-section-id=&quot;zaie7y&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Rules:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre data-end=&quot;784&quot; data-start=&quot;631&quot; class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;1. Withdraw amount must be &amp;gt; 0&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;2. User must have sufficient available balance &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;3. Locked balance increases immediately.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;4 Available balance decreases immediately.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;5. User cannot withdraw to another user&#39;s destination.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;6. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;Withdrawal must reference an existing destination.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;7. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Only Pending withdrawals may be approved or rejected.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;8. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Confirmed withdrawals cannot be modified&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
